WEBVTT

00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:30.244
Kako to uraditi?

00:09:30.244 --> 00:09:32.078
Dajte sebi dozvolu da jedete

00:09:32.078 --> 00:09:34.283
koliko god želite, i onda zaključite

00:09:34.283 --> 00:09:36.605
zbog čega se vaše
tijelo osjeća dobro.

00:09:36.605 --> 00:09:39.264
Jedite redovno u miru.

00:09:39.264 --> 00:09:41.563
Razmislite o tome
kako se vaše tijelo osjeća

00:09:41.563 --> 00:09:43.617
kada počnete jesti i kada stanete,

00:09:43.617 --> 00:09:46.104
i dozvolite da vaša glad odluči

00:09:46.104 --> 00:09:47.572
kada je dosta.

00:09:47.572 --> 00:09:49.993
Trebalo mi je godinu dana da naučim ovo,

00:09:49.993 --> 00:09:51.764
ali je vrijedilo.

00:09:51.764 --> 00:09:54.849
Sada sam puno opuštenija pored hrane

00:09:54.849 --> 00:09:57.712
nego ikada.

00:09:57.712 --> 00:10:00.277
Često ne razmišljam o tome.